        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Kalman Steel Joists Advertisement</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"Georgia\", \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n        background-color: #ffffff;\n        color: #000000;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 20px;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .document-wrapper {\n        width: 100%;\n        max-width: 900px;\n        padding: 30px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .header {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        font-family: \"Georgia\", \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    }\n    .header .date {\n        font-style: italic;\n    }\n    .main-heading {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-family: \"Arial Black\", \"Arial\", sans-serif;\n        font-size: 56px;\n        font-weight: 900;\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n        margin: 10px 0 30px 0;\n        color: white;\n        text-shadow:\n           -1px -1px 0 #000,\n            1px -1px 0 #000,\n           -1px  1px 0 #000,\n            1px  1px 0 #000,\n            3px  3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n        transform: scaleY(1.1);\n    }\n    .main-image {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 400px;\n        background-color: #f0f0f0;\n        border: 1px dashed #666;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n        font-family: sans-serif;\n        color: #555;\n    }\n    .sub-heading {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-family: \"Brush Script MT\", \"Lucida Handwriting\", cursive;\n        font-size: 46px;\n        margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    .content-columns {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 40px;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .column {\n        flex: 1;\n        font-size: 15.5px;\n        line-height: 1.45;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .column p {\n        margin-top: 0;\n        margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n    .column p.indent {\n        text-indent: 1.5em;\n    }\n    .small-caps-word {\n        font-variant: small-caps;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .drop-letter {\n        font-size: 1.3em;\n    }\n    .small-image-container {\n        width: 45%;\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    .float-right {\n        float: right;\n        margin-left: 15px;\n    }\n    .float-left {\n        float: left;\n        margin-right: 15px;\n    }\n    .small-image {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 110px;\n        background-color: #f0f0f0;\n        border: 1px dashed #666;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        font-family: sans-serif;\n        font-size: 11px;\n        color: #555;\n        padding: 5px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        text-align: center;\n    }\n    .image-caption {\n        font-family: \"Arial\", sans-serif;\n        font-size: 11px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n        margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    .footer-heading {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-family: \"Arial Black\", \"Arial\", sans-serif;\n        font-size: 40px;\n        font-weight: 900;\n        letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n        margin: 30px 0 20px 0;\n        color: white;\n        text-shadow:\n           -1px -1px 0 #000,\n            1px -1px 0 #000,\n           -1px  1px 0 #000,\n            1px  1px 0 #000,\n            2px  2px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    }\n    .footer-content {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 20px;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n    }\n    .footer-logo {\n        width: 130px;\n        height: 70px;\n        background-color: #f0f0f0;\n        border: 1px dashed #666;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        text-align: center;\n        font-family: \"Arial\", sans-serif;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        padding: 5px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        color: #333;\n    }\n    .footer-text {\n        flex: 1;\n        font-size: 10.5px;\n        line-height: 1.25;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .footer-text .company-name {\n        font-variant: small-caps;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"document-wrapper\">\n    \n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"page-num\">16</span>\n        <span class=\"date\">American Builder, July 1935.</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"main-heading\">\n        KALMAN STEEL JOISTS\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"main-image placeholder\">\n        [Illustration: A large figure of a man in a suit looking down at three miniature houses centered below him]\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sub-heading\">\n        bring added values to any home\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-columns\">\n        <div class=\"column\">\n            <p><span class=\"small-caps-word\"><span class=\"drop-letter\">W</span>HILE</span> fire-safety ranks first among the advantages of Kalman Steel Joists, they bring additional values that appeal to any prospective home-builder.</p>\n            <p class=\"indent\">The combination of Kalman Steel Joists with concrete floor slab and plaster makes a floor structure that, while forming an impassable barrier to fire, transmits very little sound and vibration, preventing noises overhead from disturbing occupants of rooms below. A floor structure that cannot shrink to cause cracks where walls and floor meet, and that is immune to the dreaded termite, whose ravages are spreading rapidly.</p>\n            <p class=\"indent\">\n                <span class=\"small-image-container float-right\">\n                    <span class=\"small-image placeholder\">[Photo: Cross-section of a Kalman Joist]</span>\n                    <span class=\"image-caption\">KALMAN JOIST</span>\n                </span>\n                These advantages, which make a difference in the building cost of only a few cents a square foot, provide the owner with a dwelling that is more\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"column\">\n            <p>livable. They make his investment sounder, because his home—which often represents the savings of years—is less subject to swift obsolescence, will need fewer repairs.</p>\n            <p class=\"indent\">Kalman Steel Joists in no way complicate the builder's work. Often they simplify it. These joists require no cutting or fitting. They reach the site in the exact lengths needed and are quickly installed and the concrete poured.</p>\n            <p class=\"indent\">Tell the prospective home-owner about the advantages of Kalman Steel Joists. The fact that he may have</p>\n            <p>\n                <span class=\"small-image-container float-left\">\n                    <span class=\"small-image placeholder\">[Photo: Cross-section of a Macmar Joist]</span>\n                    <span class=\"image-caption\">MACMAR JOIST</span>\n                </span>\n                in mind a relatively small dwelling offers no obstacle to their use. Kalman Joists can be applied as economically to a six-room home as to a large, pretentious one. They are of course adaptable to any style of architecture.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer-heading\">\n        KALMAN BUILDING STEEL\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer-content\">\n        <div class=\"footer-logo placeholder\">\n            [Logo: BETHLEHEM STEEL inside a shield/hexagon]\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer-text\">\n            <span class=\"company-name\">KALMAN STEEL CORPORATION</span>, Subsidiary of Bethlehem Steel Corporation. General Offices: Bethlehem, Pa. District Offices: Albany, Atlanta, Baltimore, Boston, Buffalo, Chicago, Cincinnati, Cleveland, Detroit, Houston, Milwaukee, Minneapolis, New York, Philadelphia, Pittsburgh, St. Louis, St. Paul, Syracuse, Washington. Pacific Coast Distributor: Pacific Coast Steel Corporation, San Francisco, Seattle, Los Angeles, Portland, Honolulu. Export Distributor: Bethlehem Steel Export Corporation, New York.\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
